{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50093","headline":"石上阁 · 无名氏","name":"石上阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水石引我去，南湖复东壑。\n不厌随竹阴，来登石上阁。\n磴道通石门，欹崖断如凿。\n飞梁架峯头，夭矫虹霓若。\n下视竹木杪，仰见悬泉落。\n水声兼松吹，音响参衆乐。\n时时爲雾雨，飘洒湿帘箔。\n吾欲弃簪缨，於兹守寂寞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50093.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50093","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}